+## Candidate selection experiments
+
+Set `LEAN_EXPLORE_SEARCH_RERANK_DEPTH=50` or `100` to rerank a larger pool
+while returning the requested number of results in both HTTP search paths.
+The budget is at least the requested result limit and must be between 1 and
+200. Leaving the variable unset preserves the existing depth-equals-limit
+behavior. The hosted MCP service already accepts a separate reranking depth.
+
+Evaluate the setting on a fixed corpus and judged query set before changing
+the serving default. More candidates can improve target coverage while
+reducing final ranking quality.
+
